### ============================================================================
### Export Endpoints
### ============================================================================

### Export meter readings (CSV)
# Fields: address_ids[], from_date, to_date, format (csv|pdf)
# Response 200 OK: Binary CSV file download
POST {{host}}/export/meter-readings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "address_ids": [1],
  "from_date": "2025-01-01",
  "to_date": "2025-02-28",
  "format": "csv"
}

### Export meter readings (PDF)
# Response 200 OK: Binary PDF file download
POST {{host}}/export/meter-readings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "address_ids": [1, 2],
  "from_date": "2025-01-01",
  "to_date": "2025-02-28",
  "format": "pdf"
}
